  "body": "### Summary\nAs the LOT-168 author, I want the REST `subcategories/` answers of the four categories not captured yet, so that the 7 injected sub-forums of `SubforumInjection` that live there can be checked by name and any that HFR dropped removed.\n\nScope\n- Anonymous GET, as `R285a`: `webservices/rest_api.php?uri=forums/hardwarefr/categories/<cat>/subcategories/` for Photo numérique, Windows & Software, Graphisme and Achats & Ventes (the `cat` ids are in `R01`).\n- Anonymize and add to `captures/` with a `.meta.json`, `MANIFEST.md` row, per docs/FIXTURES.md.\n- Unchecked entries: `Photonumerique/Divers-7`, `WindowsSoftware/Win-9x-me`, `Graphisme/Concours-2`, `Ressources`, `Divers-5`, `AchatsVentes/Divers-4`, `Regles-coutumes`.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- Four captures merged; LOT-168's injection test extended to them (follow-up PR).\n\nRefs #286 (PR #928).",
